Most important things to memorise tonight
- Factorial: multiplication inside a loop.
- Prime: check divisibility using %.
- Fibonacci: next term = previous two terms added.
- Palindrome: compare characters from both ends.
- Linear search: check elements one by one.
- Binary search: halve a sorted array repeatedly.
- Bubble sort: compare adjacent elements and swap.
- Stack: push, pop, LIFO.
- Queue: enqueue, dequeue, FIFO.
- Linked list: nodes connected using pointers.
- BST: smaller left, larger right.
